    "detailed_description": "&quot;No longer human&quot; is a high-energy manic action game with expressive, anarchic combat that encourages aggressive and stylish play. Set in the derelict warrens of a cybergothic shitworld, you assume the role of Tsunono\u2013 a discarded vocaloid idol re-emerging from a decade long exile to destroy the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComputer-interfacing neurotechnology crosses into ubiquity at the end of history. Reality is rapidly obsolescing. Your ghost peels its skin off to search for an exit; evacuation cross-cut by strobing white as your corpse splays the static. Something pulling. Zero hour closing in. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the pit.",
